wa Research Institute have?\" Xucun didn't bring his own business card. [359] \"About fifty people fixed.\" Yamane sat on the bench of the small boat. [360] West Garden is the last to board the boat. She folded her umbrella and came to Xucun's side. [361] \"Miharu, this is Shigemura-san, the Deputy Director of the research institute.\" Kusaka introduced Miharu to Shigemura. [362] \"Hello.\" Miharu quickly bowed. [363] \"You visited a month ago,\" Shigemura said with a smile to Miharu. \"I was out of town and didn't see you. I heard you are the old friend of the director\u2026\"\n[364] \"So, you mean the fourth power of an old friend,\" Miharu smiled, tilting her head slightly. \"He asked me to visit Dr. Nishikawa Harumi.\" [365] \"Ah, that's rare,\" Shigemura said. \"I also watched the video of your conversation with Dr. Nishikawa, and it was a very meaningful conversation.\" [366] \"W\u01d2 h\u00e1i r\u00e1n w\u00e9i sh\u00ec s\u012b r\u00e9n sh\u00ec j\u00ecng li\u00e0ng ne.\" M\u00e9ng hu\u00ec b\u00f9 h\u01ceo y\u00ec de d\u012b xi\u00e0 le t\u00f3u. [367] \"B\u00f9 sh\u00ec de\u2026\" T\u0101 t\u0101 ch\u016b le sh\u01d2u ju\u00e0n sh\u00ec le t\u00f3u ti\u00e1o de h\u00e0n, \"W\u01d2 z\u00e0i y\u00e1nji\u00f9 su\u01d2 l\u01d0 y\u01d0 sh\u00ed w\u01d4 ni\u00e1n le, h\u00e1i y\u012b c\u00ec b\u00f9 d\u0101ng y\u01d4 t\u0101 zh\u00ed zh\u00ed shu\u014d hu\u00e0 ne. Y\u01d2u hu\u00e0 de sh\u00ed h\u00f2u d\u00e0n d\u014du t\u014dng gu\u00f2 hu\u00e0 m\u01d2u hu\u00f2 p\u00edng k\u0101n shu\u014d, t\u00e1n hu\u00e0 n\u00e8i d\u00ecng yu\u00e1n w\u00e8i qu\u00e1n su\u01d2 k\u0101i p\u01d0ng. [368] \"B\u00f3shi shu\u00ed y\u011b ji\u00e0n ma?\" M\u00e9ng hu\u00ec w\u00e8n, \"Zh\u0113n de shu\u00ed y\u011b ji\u00e0n ma?\" [369] \"Shu\u00ed y\u011b ji\u00e0n.\" \"M\u00e9n k\u01d2u ch\u00f9 de ti\u011b b\u00e0ng f\u00e0ng xi\u00e0 le, di\u00e0n b\u014d sh\u0113ng d\u00e0 le q\u01d0 l\u00e1i. Sh\u00e0ng chu\u00e1n de zh\u01d0 y\u01d2u x\u012b chu\u0101n t\u0101 men sh\u0