ed sign for tourism, but it was no longer legible. Next to the sign, there was a four-wheel drive car parked on a grassy, overgrown patch of land. [426] \"It's about a fifteen-minute walk from here to the campsite. Please put the heavy luggage on top of the car. I can only carry four people besides me. S\u014dma-sensei and\u2026 ah, two ladies\u2026 let's prioritize the ladies and send them first.\" The two ladies referred to were Nishimura Momiji and the exchange student Xiao Wu. [427] \"And one more person,\" S\u014dma pointed to Kuni, \"I forgot to introduce her. She is my assistant Kuni-san. She is the most skilled in designing programs among us, and I am second\u2026\"\n[428] A tall woman with a straw hat, Kuni-sono, approached. She was not wearing makeup, and her head was shaved very short. Her tall stature made it difficult to recognize her as a woman. [429] \"I'll walk there,\" Kuni said reluctantly. However, she was always reluctant, and it may not be because she was in a bad mood.\n <Assistant> I have read the book and I will answer the question you ask.\n\nPassage 2:\nDialogue between User and Assistant 2026-06-12 03:47:35 \\n<User> The following context is the book I have read: \n\"sh\u00ec ma? H\u00f3ng m\u00f2 j\u00ec de b\u01cen b\u011bn s\u00ec k\u0101i sh\u01d0 y\u00f2ng de sh\u00ed ji\u0101n ma?\" [3372] \"X\u012b chu\u0101n w\u00e8n d\u01ceo ti\u00e1n.\" D\u01ceo ti\u00e1n zh\u00e8ng d\u0101i d\u0101i zhe zu\u01d0 k\u01d2u k\u00e0n zhe X\u012b chu\u0101n, ji\u00e0n d\u00e0o hu\u00ed gu\u00f2 sh\u0113n, ji\u0101n s\u00f9 w\u00e9n ji\u00e0n. Qu\u00e8 r\u00e8n c\u01d0 sh\u00ed, Zhu\u00e0n zhu\u01cen zhu\u01cen zhe sh\u0113n. \"y\u00ec de, zh\u00e8ng sh\u00ec zh\u00e8 y\u00e0ng\u2026\"\n[3373] \"L\u01ceo sh\u012b\u2026 n\u00e0 g\u00e8\u2026\" M\u00e9ng hu\u00ec xi\u01ceo sh\u0113ng w\u00e8n, \"k\u011b y\u01d0 w\u00e8n w\u00e8n t\u00ed ma?\" [3374] \"K\u011b y\u01d0. Y\u01d0 z\u00fa g\u014dng zu\u00f2 le. \"X\u012b chu\u0101n w\u0113i xi\u00e0o zhe ch\